{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Radiant is a lovecraftian soulslike set on an island where interdimensional flesh demons harvest humanity's pain in the form of loosh to power their dark machinations. You are a Victorian-era gentleman seeking to control this precious resource. So you come to the island that exists outside of time and space seeking the power of gods. What will you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/8520741cab41ed675fbd05354c4987a3.poster.avif?t=1763737310\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/8520741cab41ed675fbd05354c4987a3.webm?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/8520741cab41ed675fbd05354c4987a3.mp4?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/3ac6300d938dc7d0f2ae0a9b96d48bc8.avif?t=1763737310\" width=498 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/7ce3c06f13c32ee3001f07387e79b7c2.poster.avif?t=1763737310\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/7ce3c06f13c32ee3001f07387e79b7c2.webm?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/7ce3c06f13c32ee3001f07387e79b7c2.mp4?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/f067623a83d8f7a0e18c820c0d302474.avif?t=1763737310\" width=498 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/fd99b80af778245033a697778f8b5f80.poster.avif?t=1763737310\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/fd99b80af778245033a697778f8b5f80.webm?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/fd99b80af778245033a697778f8b5f80.mp4?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/330819cc5521858267f44f9e3e971185.avif?t=1763737310\" width=498 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/579e43ea52d05041189ec07443e5e2a4.poster.avif?t=1763737310\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/579e43ea52d05041189ec07443e5e2a4.webm?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/579e43ea52d05041189ec07443e5e2a4.mp4?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/f65563bdbab02147252c59e904ead076.avif?t=1763737310\" width=498 height=76 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is difficult but fair. Every enemy encounter is potentially deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the weapon that works best for your playstyle: great sword, samurai sword, axe, hammer, dagger, a chainsaw, magic weapons, throwing knives, dynamite, flame and lightning buffs, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet NPCs and learn about the world around you. Help them and they can become vendors in your sanctuary or unlock secret areas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, dash, roll, block, break poise, normal attack, heavy attack, and backstab your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish cryptic quests, uncover secrets, and make choices to unlock 5 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping, interconnected levels and optional bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight wolves, cultists, assassins, sea zombies, skull knights, forest guardians, biblically accurate angels, mutant flesh spiders, Cthulhu himself, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate beaches, cliffs, towns, castles, research institutes, the future, and alien dimensions. Find hidden equipment and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New Game Plus for added difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies gives you loosh. Loosh is used to level up your stats or purchase items from vendors. Death results in the loss of loosh, with one chance for recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/5606153178cf6653d3b48e811dd4656d.poster.avif?t=1763737310\