: great sword, samurai sword, axe, hammer, dagger, a chainsaw, magic weapons, throwing knives, dynamite, flame and lightning buffs, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet NPCs and learn about the world around you. Help them and they can become vendors in your sanctuary or unlock secret areas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, dash, roll, block, break poise, normal attack, heavy attack, and backstab your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish cryptic quests, uncover secrets, and make choices to unlock 5 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping, interconnected levels and optional bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight wolves, cultists, assassins, sea zombies, skull knights, forest guardians, biblically accurate angels, mutant flesh spiders, Cthulhu himself, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate beaches, cliffs, towns, castles, research institutes, the future, and alien dimensions. Find hidden equipment and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New Game Plus for added difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies gives you loosh. Loosh is used to level up your stats or purchase items from vendors. Death results in the loss of loosh, with one chance for recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/5606153178cf6653d3b48e811dd4656d.poster.avif?t=1763737310\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/5606153178cf6653d3b48e811dd4656d.webm?t=1763737310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697460/extras/5606153178cf6653d3b48e81